category: Utils
build-depends: cygport libboost-devel libbz2-devel libexpat-devel liblua-devel libpq-devel libpq5 libproj-devel lua nlohmann_json proj zlib-devel
sdesc: "OpenStreetMap data to PostgreSQL converter"
ldesc: "osm2pgsql is a tool for loading OpenStreetMap data into a PostgreSQL / PostGIS
database suitable for applications like rendering into a map, geocoding with
Nominatim, or general analysis."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/osm2pgsql-dev/osm2pgsql
